---
import Biz from '../../components/Biz.astro';
import Prose from '../../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { siteData } from '../../lib/site';

const { business: b } = await siteData();
---

<Prose
  title={`Delivery policy | ${b.brandName}`}
  description="How OSuite is delivered: a download and a licence key by email, with nothing shipped."
  lines={['How it', 'arrives']}
  standfirst="OSuite is software. Nothing is shipped: you download it, and your licence key arrives by email."
  meta="Last updated 15 October 2026"
>
  <h2>The software</h2>
  <p>The installer is downloaded from osuite.business. It works as a free trial for 14 days without any key.</p>

  <h2>Your licence key</h2>
  <p>
    When a payment goes through, the licence key is emailed to the address you bought with, normally within minutes and always within one working
    day. Enter it in OSuite under Licence to activate the plan you bought.
  </p>

  <h2>Cloud hosting</h2>
  <p>If you buy cloud hosting, we set up your company’s address and send the sign-in details by email within two working days.</p>

  <h2>If it does not arrive</h2>
  <p>
    Check your spam folder, then write to <Biz k="supportEmail" link="mailto" fallback="us" /> or call <Biz k="phone" link="tel" fallback="us" />.
    We resend the key or fix the problem the same working day.
  </p>
</Prose>
